!!omap
  - id: F039
  - function: ReadReservationPeriod
  - range:
      - 740
      - 751
  - args:
      - ReservationPtr *ReservationInfo
      - RoomPtr *Room
  - return: void
  - requirement: !!omap
      - trigger: ''
      - action: ''
      - effect: ''
      - constraint: ''
  - code: "void ReadReservationPeriod(ReservationPtr *ReservationInfo, RoomPtr *Room)\n\
      {\n  printf(\"\\nEnter Reservation Date & Time:\");\n  (*ReservationInfo)->Date
      = ReadDate(\" => Date [Day Month Year]: \");\n  (*ReservationInfo)->Start_Time
      = ReadTime(\" => Start Time [Hour Minute]: \");\n  (*ReservationInfo)->End_Time
      = ReadTime(\" => End Time [Hour Minute]: \");\n\n  (*Room)->Date = (*ReservationInfo)->Date;\n\
      \  (*Room)->Start_Time = (*ReservationInfo)->Start_Time;\n  (*Room)->End_Time
      = (*ReservationInfo)->End_Time;\n  (*Room)->IsReserved = true;\n}\n"
  - description: この関数は、予約情報を入力し、その情報を指定された予約構造体と部屋構造体に格納して、部屋の予約状態を更新します。
